{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/958471-lovecraft-inspired-storyline","id":958471,"title":"Lovecraft inspired storyline","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-26T16:11:59-07:00","id":958471,"title":"Lovecraft inspired storyline","content":"I don't want to rip off Lovecraft''s stories exactly but I'd like to do some similar decent into occult type storyline. I would like advice on how to develop a story and set the pace.<br /> <br /> I feel like pace is key, take too long players get board give them too much too soon. No fun or mystery","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2191-kevorkiandoctor","name":"Kevorkiandoctor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T16:35:55-07:00","id":958487,"title":"","content":"Start out with a cult. Then come up with a horrific belief system. Next think of the implications of that belief system being true.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","name":"K9ine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12094_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T00:41:23-07:00","id":958630,"title":"","content":"You can look into <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/956545-open-call-the-mythos-chronicles\">Mythos Chronicles topic</a> also... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T10:02:30-07:00","id":959314,"title":"","content":"I'm playing in a V20 lovecraft-based game. There's a secret lodge of vampire occultists that are fighting over an ancient evil vampire in a jar from the middle east that is broadcasting a psychic call to all it's children (distressingly I think that counts my character as one). It drove the archeological team that brought it from it's resting place to the city insane and seems to be transforming the one survivor into something else. Once it got into town, any time a vampire kills someone through feeding the victim rises as a slimy vampire deep one. There's an underground warren of cannibal vampire mole people and no one believes my character because when he says &quot;there is an underground city of mole people and they have sent me with a warning for you&quot; people look at him like he's crazy or something. Also they're necromancers now, thanks to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank"